Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 21:46:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/71] Apply rustfmt to the call sites the active_turn_id
 parameter reflowed

Adding active_turn_id to for_prompt pushed several calls past the line
limit, and one assert! in client_tests.rs was already drifting from the
current rustfmt style. No behavior changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
